{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/41630ab4074492e61a431980cecf86ca.poster.avif?t=1757694949\" width=624 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/41630ab4074492e61a431980cecf86ca.webm?t=1757694949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/41630ab4074492e61a431980cecf86ca.mp4?t=1757694949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>BEERCRUSH</strong></i> is a psychotic, fast-paced roguelike where you need to drink beer to stay alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the profoundly average\u00a0<strong>John Beer</strong>\u00a0to jump, slide, and boost your way through crazy worlds! Use your incredible  alcoholism to stay alive by chugging beer, gain new abilities by talking to Kyle, and get to the bottom of... whatever is going on here.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improve your abilities with Bottlecaps!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/6b20c73a920f6c949433ffb3c5d7105a.poster.avif?t=1757694949\" width=636 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/6b20c73a920f6c949433ffb3c5d7105a.webm?t=1757694949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/6b20c73a920f6c949433ffb3c5d7105a.mp4?t=1757694949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escaping a world will grant you an upgrade to your abilities, known as <strong>Bottlecaps</strong>! Mix and match up to three of them to your liking to blow past future worlds with ease!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRINK BEER!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/30896fc96229443fe79f8d9aa8466441.poster.avif?t=1757694949\" width=634 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/30896fc96229443fe79f8d9aa8466441.webm?t=1757694949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/30896fc96229443fe79f8d9aa8466441.mp4?t=1757694949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every world has a unique beer drinking minigame. Some are easier than others... you'll need to master them all to stay alive and get to where you're going!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8+ frantic, procedurally generated worlds to chug beer in!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ Bottlecaps, equip these to gain new abilities ranging from a shield of beer to a shotgun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3+ Gamemodes, each providing a unique take on John Beer's adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable Borders to customize your experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rockin' original soundtrack, perfect for getting your stomach pumped!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also beer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So go ahead! LIVE LIFE! EVERY GOLDEN MINUTE OF IT!!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912370?t=1757694949","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/885daeaeebbeb7d26ab510805c65e9139003ebfb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757694949","capsule_image":"https:/